// This version keeps the mathematical algorithm identical to the original
// Durbin recurrence, but applies two important optimizations:
//
// 1) The temporary array z[] and the two loops that used it are replaced
//    by an *in-place symmetric pair update* of y[0..k-1]. This reduces
//    memory traffic and improves cache behavior while preserving numerical
//    semantics.
